WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.457
Start a new empty ChatGPT chat. (3× speed)

00:00:00.457 --> 00:00:00.748
Choose the workshop book from the computer. (3× speed)

00:00:00.748 --> 00:00:00.955
The workshop book is attached. (3× speed)

00:00:00.955 --> 00:00:01.134
Write the request using the attached book. (3× speed)

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:05.278
Write the guided study request using the attached chapter. (3× speed)

00:00:05.278 --> 00:00:05.423
Select the native Study action after writing the prompt. (3× speed)

00:00:05.423 --> 00:00:05.769
Select Study from the native slash menu. (3× speed)

00:00:05.769 --> 00:00:07.964
Read the complete request with Study selected.

00:00:07.964 --> 00:00:08.369
Send the attached chapter and Study request. (3× speed)

00:00:08.369 --> 00:00:08.854
Study prepares the first diagnostic question. (4× speed)

00:00:08.854 --> 00:00:15.312
Read the diagnostic question before answering.

00:00:15.312 --> 00:00:15.910
Try an explanation and use the feedback to improve it.

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:19.810
Focus the learner answer field

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:20.274
Send the learner answer

00:00:20.274 --> 00:00:20.896
ChatGPT prepares feedback. (4× speed)

00:00:20.896 --> 00:00:24.643
Read the hint before revising the explanation.

00:00:24.643 --> 00:00:25.105
Revise the explanation using the chapter’s distinction.

00:00:25.105 --> 00:00:30.342
Focus the learner answer field

00:00:30.342 --> 00:00:30.837
Send the learner answer

00:00:30.837 --> 00:00:31.443
ChatGPT prepares feedback. (4× speed)

00:00:31.443 --> 00:00:35.201
Read the corrected distinction and the next question.

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:35.708
Explain tokens and words in your own words.

00:00:35.708 --> 00:00:41.148
Focus the learner answer field

00:00:41.148 --> 00:00:41.613
Send the learner answer

00:00:41.613 --> 00:00:42.156
ChatGPT prepares feedback. (4× speed)

00:00:42.156 --> 00:00:47.335
Check feedback, then distinguish token probability from truth.

00:00:47.335 --> 00:00:48.423
Ask for a hint before answering.

00:00:48.423 --> 00:00:52.475
Focus the learner answer field

00:00:52.475 --> 00:00:53.510
Send the learner answer

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:54.083
ChatGPT prepares feedback. (4× speed)

00:00:54.083 --> 00:00:59.002
Use the hint to separate likely continuations from verified facts.

00:00:59.002 --> 00:00:59.968
Answer in your own words, then check the feedback.

00:00:59.968 --> 00:01:06.883
Focus the learner answer field

00:01:06.883 --> 00:01:07.628
Send the learner answer

00:01:07.628 --> 00:01:08.200
ChatGPT prepares feedback. (4× speed)

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:12.498
Check the source-linked feedback before the final independent explanation.

00:01:12.498 --> 00:01:13.397
Finish with an independent explanation.

00:01:13.397 --> 00:01:22.698
Focus the learner answer field

00:01:22.698 --> 00:01:23.309
Send the learner answer

00:01:23.309 --> 00:01:23.927
ChatGPT prepares feedback. (4× speed)

00:01:23.927 --> 00:01:30.883
Compare the final explanation with the sources and check it independently.
